title: "STRIDE: Stride-level Tracking and Integrated Decision Extraction"
abstract: >-
  An automated pipeline for dual cognitive and motor phenotyping of mice in the T-maze
  rewarded-alternation task from bottom-up video, using SLEAP pose estimation.
